  "title": "Bidding Farewell to the Two Imams (Naqi & Askari) — Samarra",
  "data": "Salat-Dua- Farewell\nOffer the Ziyarah Prayer and then you may say the following dua:\nيَا ذَا ٱلْقُدْرَةِ ٱلْجَامِعَةِ\nYAA ZAL QUDRATIL JAAME-A’TE\nO Lord of omnipotent power!\nوَٱلرَّحْمَةِ ٱلْوَاسِعَةِ\nWAR RAHMATIL WAASE-A’TE\nO Lord of all-inclusive mercy!\nوَٱلْمِنَنِ ٱلْمُتَتَابِعَةِ\nWAL MENANIL MOTATAABE-A’TE\nO Lord of successive favors!\nوَٱلآلاَءِ ٱلْمُتَوَاتِرَةِ\nWAL AALAAA-IL MOTAWAATERATE\nO Lord of uninterrupted bounties!\nوَٱلايَادِي ٱلْجَلِيلَةِ\nWAL AYAADIL JALEELATE\nO Lord of magnificent bestowals!\nوَٱلْمَوَاهِبِ ٱلْجَزِيلَةِ\nWAL MAWAAHEBIL JAZEELATE\nO Lord of abundant conferrals!\nصَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ ٱلصَّادِقِينَ\nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIS SAADEQEENA\n(Please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad the veracious ones,\nوَاعْطِنِي سُؤْلِي\nWA A-A’TENEE SOALEE\ngrant me that which I ask from You,\nوَٱجْمَعْ شَمْلِي\nWAJ MA’ SHAMLEE\nre-unify me (with my family),\nوَلُمَّ شَعْثِي\nWA LUMMA SHA’SEE\nunite me (with my family),\nوَزَكِّ عَمَلِي\nWA ZAKKE A’MALEE\npurify my deeds,\nوَلاَ تُزِغْ قَلْبِي بَعْدَ إِِذْ هَدَيْتَنِي\nWA LAA TOZIGH QALBEE BA’DA IZ HADAYTANEE\ncause not my heart to stray after You have guided me,\nوَلاَ تُزِلَّ قَدَمِي\nWA LAA TOZILLA QADAMEE\ncause not my footstep to slip,\nوَلاَ تَكِلْنِي إِلَىٰ نَفْسِي طَرْفَةَ عَيْنٍ ابَداً\nWA LAA TAKILNEE ELAA NAFSEE TARFATA A’YNIN ABADAN\nnever refer me to myself even for a time as short as a wink of an eye,\nوَلاَ تُخَيِّبْ طَمَعِي\nWA LAA TOKHAYYIB TAMA-E’E\ndisappoint not my desire,\nوَلاَ تُبْدِ عَوْرَتِي\nWA LAA TUBDE A’WRATEE\nexpose not my private parts,\nوَلاَ تَهْتِكْ سِتْرِي\nWA LAA TAHTIK SITREE\ndisclose not my covering,\nوَلاَ تُوحِشْنِي وَلاَ تُؤْيِسْنِي\nWA LAA TOOHISHNEE WA LAA TOAYISNEE\ncause me not to feel lonely, despair me not,\nوَكُنْ بِي رَؤُوفاً رَحِيماً\nWA KUN BEE RA-OOFAR RAHEEMAN\nbe to me kind and merciful,\nوَٱهْدِنِي وَزَكِّنِي\nWAH DENEE WA ZAKKENEE\nguide me (to the right path), make me grow,\nوَطَهِّرْنِي وَصَفِّنِي\nWA TAHHIRNEE WA SAFFENEE\npurify me, cleanse me,\nوَٱصْطَفِنِي وَخَلِّصْنِي وَٱسْتَخْلِصْنِي\nWAS TAFENEE WA KHALLISNEE WAS TAKHLISNEE\ndedicate me to You, select me, render me suitable,\nوَٱصْنَعْنِي وَٱصْطَنِعْنِي\nWAS NA’NEE WAS TANE’NEE\narrange me for You alone, attach me to Yourself,\nوَقَرِّبْنِي إِِلَيْكَ وَلاَ تُبَاعِدْنِي مِنْكَ\nWA QARRIBNEE ELAYKA WA LAA TOBAA-I’DNEE MINKA\ndraw me near You, take me not far away from You,\nوَٱلْطُفْ بِي وَلاَ تَجْفُنِي\nWAL TUF BEE WA LAA TAJFONEE\nbe kind to me, do not turn away from me,\nوَاكْرِمْنِي وَلاَ تُهِنِّي\nWA AKRIMNEE WA LAA TOHINNEE\nhonor me, do not humiliate me,\nوَمَا اسْالُكَ فَلاَ تَحْرِمْنِي\nWA MAA AS-ALOKA FALAA TAHRIMNEE\ndo not deprive me of all that which I ask from You,\nوَمَا لاََ اسْالُكَ فَٱجْمَعْهُ لِي\nWA MAA LAA AS-ALOKA FAJMA’HO LEE\nand give me altogether all that which I have not asked from You.\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا ارْحَمَ ٱلرَّاحِمِينَ\nBE-RAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA\n(Please do all that) in the name of Your mercy, O most merciful of all those who show mercy.\nوَاسْالُكَ بِحُرْمَةِ وَجْهِكَ ٱلْكَرِيمِ\nWA AS-ALOKA BE-HURMATE WAJHEKAL KAREEME\nI also beseech You in the name of the sacredness of Your Honorable Face,\nوَبِحُرْمَةِ نَبِيِّكَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA BE-HURMATE NABIYYEKA MOHAMMADIN\nthe sanctity of Your Prophet Muhammad,\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ\nSALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nmay Your blessings be upon him and upon his Household,\nوَبِحُرْمَةِ اهْلِ بَيْتِ رَسُولِكَ\nWA BE-HURMATE AHLE BAYTE RASOOLEKA\nand the sanctity of Your Prophets Household;\nامِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلِيٍّ\nAMEERIL MOAMENEENA A’LIYYIN\nnamely, Ali the Commander of the Faithful,\nوَٱلْحَسَنِ وَٱلْحُسَيْنِ\nWAL HASANE WAL HOSAYNE\nal-Hasan, al-Husayn,\nوَعَلِيٍّ وَمُحَمَّدٍ\nWA A’LIYYINW WA MOHAMMADIN\nAli, Muhammad,\nوَجَعْفَرٍ ومُوسَىٰ\nWA JA’FARINW WA MOOSAA\nJa`far, Musa,\nوَعَلَيٍّ وَمُحَمَّدٍ\nWA A’LIYYINW WA MOHAMMADIN\nAli, Muhammad,\nوَعَلِيٍّ وَٱلْحَسَنِ\nWA A’LIYYINW WAL HASANE\nAli, al-Hasan,\nوَٱلْخَلَفِ ٱلْبَاقِي\nWAL KHALAFIL BAAQEE\nand the Remaining Successor;\nصَلَوَاتُكَ وَبَرَكَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِمِ\nSALAWAATOKA WA BARAKAATOKA A’LAYHIM\nmay Your benedictions and blessings be upon them all,\nانْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلَيْهِمْ اجْمَعِينَ\nAN TOSALLEYA A’LAYHIM AJMA-E’ENA\n(I beseech You in their names) to send blessings upon all of them,\nوَتُعَجِّلَ فَرَجَ قَائِمِهِمْ بِامْرِكَ\nWA TO-A’JJELA FARAJA QAAA-EMEHIM BE-AMREKA\nhasten the Relief of their Rising Imam by Your permission,\nوَتَنْصُرَهُ وَتَنْتَصِرَ بِهِ لِدِينِكَ\nWA TANSORAHU WA TANTASERA BEHI LE-DEENEKA\nsupport him, betake him as the means of victory of Your religion,\nوَتَجْعَلَنِي فِي جُمْلَةِ ٱلنَّاجِينَ بِهِ\nWA TAJ-A’LANEE FEE JUMLATIN NAAJEENA BEHI\nand include me with those who shall be redeemed through him\nوَٱلْمُخْلِصِينَ فِي طَاعَتِهِ\nWAL MUKHLESEENA FEE TAA-A’TEHI\nand those who act sincerely in obedience to him.\nوَاسْالُكَ بِحَقِّهِمْ\nWA AS-ALOKA BE-HAQQEHIM\nI also beseech You in the name of their right\nلَمَّا ٱسْتَجَبْتَ لِي دَعْوَتِي\nLAMMAS TAJABTA LEE DA’WATEE\nto respond to my prayer,\nوَقَضَيْتَ لِي حَاجَتِي\nWA QAZAYTA LEE HAAJATEE\ngrant me my needs,\nوَاعْطَيْتَنِي سُؤْلِي\nWA A-A’TAYTANEE SOALEE\nanswer my requests,\nوَكَفَيْتَنِي مَا اهَمَّنِي\nWA KAFAYTANEE MAA AHAMMANEE\nand save me from whatever aggrieves me\nمِنْ امْرِ دُنْيَايَ وَآخِرَتِي\nMIN AMRE DUNYAAYA WA AAKHERATEE\nfrom the affairs of this world as well as the world to come.\nيَا ارْحَمَ ٱلرَّاحِمِينَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA\nO most merciful of all those who show mercy!\nيَا نُورُ يَا بُرْهَانُ\nYAA NOORO YAA BURHAANO\nO Light! O Evident!\nيَا مُنِيرُ يَا مُبِينُ\nYAA MONEERO YAA MOBEENO\nO Granter of light! O Granter of evidence!\nيَا رَبِّ ٱكْفِنِي شَرَّ ٱلشُّرُورِ\nYAA RABBIK FENEE SHARRASH SHOROORE\nO Lord! (Please do) save me from all evils\nوَآفَاتِ ٱلدُّهُورِ\nWA AAFAATID DOHOORE\nand from vicissitudes of time.\nوَاسْالُكَ ٱلنَّجَاةَ\nWA AS-ALOKAN NAJAATA\nI also beseech You for redemption\nيَوْمَ يُنْفَخُ فِي ٱلصُّورِ\nYAWMA YUNFAKHO FIS SOORE\non the Day when the Trumpet is blown.\nYou may then pray Almighty Allah for anything you wish.\nYou may also repeat the following prayer as many times as possible:\nيَا عُدَّتِي عِنْدَ ٱلْعُدَدِ\nYAA U’DDATEE I’NDAL O’DADE\nO my means when I lack means!\nوَيَا رَجَائِي وَٱلْمُعْتَمَدَ\nWA YAA RAJAAA-EE WAL MO’TAMADA\nO my hope and my trust!\nوَيَا كَهْفِي وَٱلسَّنَدَ\nWA YAA KAHFEE WAS SANADA\nO my haven and my support!\nيَا وَاحِدُ يَا احَدُ\nYAA WAAHEDO YAA AHADO\nO One! O One and Only!\nوَيَا قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ احَدٌ\nWA YAA QUL HOWAL LAAHO AHADUN\nO (described in) \"Say: He is Allah, the One.\"\nاسْالُكَ ٱللَّهُمَّ بِحَقِّ مَنْ خَلَقْتَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nAS-ALOKAL LAAHUMMA BEHAQQE MAN KHALAQTA MIN KHALQEKA\nI beseech You in the name of those whom You created from among Your creations\nوَلَمْ تَجْعَلْ فِي خَلْقِكَ مِثْلَهُمْ احَداً\nWA LAM TAJ-A’L FEE KHALQEKA MISLAHUM AHADAN\nbut You have not made anyone to be like them at all,\nصَلِّ عَلَىٰ جَمَاعَتِهِمْ\nSALLE A’LAA JAMAA-A’TEHIM\n(please do) send blessings upon them all...\nYou may now submit your requests (before Almighty Allah). Imam al-Hadi, peace be upon him, is reported to have said, \"I have besought Allah the Almighty and All-majestic not to disappoint any one who says this prayer in my shrine.\"\nBidding Farewell to the two imams\nWhen you intend to bid farewell to the two holy Imams, you may stop at the holy tomb and say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكُمَا يَا وَلِيَّيِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKOMAA YAA WALIYYAYIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon both of you, O Allah’s representatives.\nاسْتَوْدِعُكُمَا ٱللَّهَ\nASTAWDE-O’KOMAL LAAHA\nI entrust you both with Allah\nوَاقْرَا عَلَيْكُمَا ٱلسَّلاَمَ\nWA AQRAA A’LAYKOMAS SALAAMA\nand invoke His peace upon you both.\nآمَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَبِٱلرَّسُولِ\nAAMANNAA BILLAAHE WA BIR-RASOOLE\nWe believe in Allah, in the Messenger,\nوَبِمَا جِئْتُمَا بِهِ وَدَلَلْتُمَا عَلَيْهِ\nWA BEMAA JEATOMAA BEHI WA DALALTOMAA A’LAYHE\nand in that which you both have come with and instructed.\nاَللَّهُمَّ ٱكْتُبْنَا مَعَ ٱلشَّاهِدينَ\nALLAAHUMMAK TUBNAA MA-A’SH SHAAHEDEENA\nO Allah, write us down with those who bear witness.\nاَللَّهُمَّ لاََ تَجْعَلْهُ آخِرَ ٱلْعَهْدِ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ-A’LHO AAKHERAL A’HDE\nO Allah, (please) do not decide this visit\nمِنْ زِيَارَتِي إِِيَّاهُمَا\nMIN ZEYAARATEE IYYAAHOMAA\nto be the last visit of mine to them;\nوَٱرْزُقْنِي ٱلْعَوْدَ إِِلَيْهِمَا\nWAR ZUQNIL A’WDA ELAYHEMAA\nrather, grant me more chances to re-visit them\nوَٱحْشُرْنِي مَعَهُمَا\nWAH SHURNEE MA-A’HOMAA\nand include me with both of them,\nوَمَعَ آبَائِهِمَا ٱلطَّاهِرِينَ\nWA MA-A’ AABAAA-EHEMAT TAAHEREENA\nwith their immaculate fathers,\nوَٱلْقَائِمِ ٱلْحُجَّةِ مِنْ ذُرِّيَّتِهِمَا\nWAL QAAA-EMIL HUJJATE MIN ZURRIYYATEHEMAA\nand with the Rising, Argument Imam from their offspring.\nيَا ارْحَمَ ٱلرَّاحِمِينَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA\nO most merciful of all those who show mercy."
}
